pair and upgrade vehicles to drive and defend<br>● Deal with hundreds of thrilling events with many possible outcomes<br><br>...And much more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/872680/extras/fc82c325a42e77deb51eba3ade0c197c.poster.avif?t=1745533638\" width=676 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/872680/extras/fc82c325a42e77deb51eba3ade0c197c.webm?t=1745533638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/872680/extras/fc82c325a42e77deb51eba3ade0c197c.mp4?t=1745533638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
